  (text "HEADPHONE AMP NOTES\n- Per channel: OPA1612 + 2x LME49600 inside the loop, 2.2R ballast each, feedback from OUT_x.\n- Gain: 1 + 2.00k / (4.02k || 576R) = 4.97 (SW401 closed, High) or 1.50 (open, Low).\n- 2 W into 32R = 8 Vrms, 354 mA peak (177 mA per LME49600, rated 250 mA).\n- Relay K401 (NO contacts) connects jacks only when RDRV is high:\n  ~2-3 s after power-up (220k / 10u on RDRV), released at once if +18V4 sags (U406A), -16V collapses (U406B),\n  either output has DC beyond about +-0.6 V (Q402/Q403), or XMOS pulls HP_EN low (BAT54 D402).\n- LME49600 BW pin open = low-power mode (~7.3 mA Iq). Keep each TO-263 tab on >= 4 cm2 copper."
    (at 20 380 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "540de876-8edb-5ccc-a192-8d82f8e498d6")
  )
)
